 it (redis, postgres). extract: true runs a lightweight heuristic to pull durable facts from recent turns into long-term recall."},"915":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/memory-29","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/capabilities/memory#events-and-scoping","content":"Listen for memory:updated when the store changes. Scope recall with session options:"},"916":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/memory-30","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/capabilities/memory#related","content":"Durable sessions — durableSessions persists wire session history (separate from memory store)"},"917":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/memory-31","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/capabilities/memory#related","content":"showcase /memory — interactive recall demo"},"918":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/memory-32","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/capabilities/memory#related","content":"examples/showcase — memory: { store: \"memory\" } in full-stack demo"},"919":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","type":"page","content":"Orchestration","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Capabilities"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration"},"920":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration-0","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","content":"Parallel subagents and plan mode"},"921":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration-1","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration#plan-mode","content":"Plan mode"},"922":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration-2","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration#parallel-subagents","content":"Parallel subagents"},"923":{"id":"/docs/capabilities/orchestration-3","page_id":"/docs/capabilities/orch